    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d399">

                <pb facs="0446" n="362" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg362"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. No. 763.72112/9762</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bailly-Blanchard</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-07T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1918, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 11, 3.03
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s confidential August 3, 7 p.m. Result of conference held this morning
                    is that all German firms in Haiti are now being, or <pb facs="0447" n="363"
                        xml:id="pg363"/> will be, sequestrated. Pursuant to presidential decree of
                    July 24 as to sequestration, forwarded in my No. 252 of July 27,<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d399-f1"/> Maumus, receiver several [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >general</hi>], and Scarpa, director of the bank, were appointed
                    sequestrators by the Minister of Justice.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blanchard</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
